  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:machei_umassei">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:machei_umassei/1"/>He wounds and heals, He slays and revives,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:machei_umassei/2"/>He raises up from the pit to life eternal.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:machei_umassei/3"/>When a son sins, his father smites him,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:machei_umassei/4"/>but then a compassionate father
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:machei_umassei/5"/>heals his wound.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:machei_umassei/6"/>A rebellious slave is put in chains,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:machei_umassei/7"/>but if the master desires, he breaks the chains.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:machei_umassei/8"/>We are Your firstborn
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:machei_umassei/9"/>and we have sinned against You—
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:machei_umassei/10"/>—our souls are filled with bitter affliction.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:machei_umassei/11"/>We are Your slaves,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:machei_umassei/12"/>and we rebelled against You—
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:machei_umassei/13"/>—some of us have endured plunder,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:machei_umassei/14"/>some captivity, some the whip.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:machei_umassei/15"/>We beseech You, in Your abundant mercy,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:machei_umassei/16"/>heal our overwhelming pain,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:machei_umassei/17"/>so that we are not completely annihilated
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:machei_umassei/18"/>in exile.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
